w("## Why This Structure? (Layered Architecture)")
w("")
w("The project follows a 3-tier layered architecture:")
w("")
w("    [1] UI Layer (Swing frames in ui/)")
w("         | calls service methods")
w("    [2] Service Layer (business rules in service/)")
w("         | calls DAO methods")
w("    [3] DAO Layer (SQL + JDBC in dao/)")
w("         | uses JDBC connection from util/")
w("    [4] MySQL Database")
w("")
w("Benefits of this separation:")
w("  - Service layer enforces business rules before the DAO can touch the database.")
w("  - DAO layer knows nothing about Swing - it only deals with Java objects and SQL.")
w("  - Model objects are shared between layers without coupling the layers together.")
w("  - You can change the UI without touching the DAO, or change the DB without")
w("    touching the Swing code.")
w("")
w("EXCEPTION: CustomerDashboardFrame.loadBookingHistory() writes SQL directly in the UI")
w("class instead of going through a DAO. This is a deviation from the clean layered pattern.")
w("")
w("---")
