w("  IMPORTANT: All seed password_hashes are placeholder strings:")
w("    pbkdf2_sha256$600000$saltsaltsaltsalt$hashhashhashhashhashhashhashhash")
w("  These are NOT real computed hashes. Seed users cannot log in with these.")
w("  To test login: use the Register screen to create a new account,")
